WEBVTT

00:06.240 --> 00:07.520
Issue orders

00:07.600 --> 00:09.000
Summon General Zhu

00:09.400 --> 00:10.800
Yes

00:14.320 --> 00:16.800
Your servant pays respects to Your Majesty

00:20.320 --> 00:21.920
Your Majesty's arrow wound

00:22.440 --> 00:23.840
Is it better?

00:25.320 --> 00:26.720
I am well

00:26.920 --> 00:28.520
I summoned you today

00:28.760 --> 00:30.160
To discuss important matters

00:31.360 --> 00:32.360
Now

00:32.440 --> 00:34.080
Now that all directions are settled

00:34.160 --> 00:36.800
I must consider Xuan Kingdom's future

00:37.400 --> 00:38.800
For Xuan Kingdom's state

00:40.120 --> 00:41.520
What do you think

00:42.040 --> 00:44.520
Should this throne be passed to whom?

00:47.360 --> 00:48.760
Your servant thinks

00:51.640 --> 00:53.040
The Second Prince

00:53.600 --> 00:55.267
Is more like Your Majesty

00:56.040 --> 00:57.440
I understand

